## Change Summary

| File | Changes |
|------|---------|
| `FindReplaceBox.vue` | ✨ **NEW** - Find/replace panel with match highlighting, navigation, and replace functionality |
| `ChatInputBox.vue` | Added `showFindReplace` state; Integrated FindReplaceBox component; Added Ctrl+H keyboard shortcut to toggle; Added `onFindReplace()` method to handle replace operations |

---

## Features

✅ **Find functionality**: Case-insensitive search with match counter  
✅ **Navigation**: Previous/Next buttons to cycle through matches  
✅ **Replace one**: Replace current match only  
✅ **Replace all**: Replace all occurrences  
✅ **Keyboard shortcuts**: Ctrl+H (or Cmd+H on Mac) to toggle find/replace  
✅ **Enter key support**: Press Enter in find field to go to next match  
✅ **Responsive**: Buttons adapt for mobile view  
✅ **DaisyUI components**: Uses input, button, and icon classes

I'll fix the replace all functionality and add auto-population of the find field from selected text.

